<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh's forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh's forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's foreign exchange market was closed on Tuesday for the New Year holiday.</p>
<p>The Bangladesh taka closed at 42.5370/5400 to the dollar in interbank trading on Monday against the previous 42.5440/5460.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
</text>
